      "value": "Oops, I forgot to write my environment.\nVRChat Build Version: 1160\nOS: Windows 10 Pro 21H1\nCPU: Core i5 10400F\nRAM: 32GB\nGPU: Geforce RTX 2060 Super\nHMD: Valve Index",
